{"title":"2022 USAMO Problems/Problem 5","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2022_USAMO_Problems/Problem_5&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>A function <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/d/e/0de76c5578271e528e6a459560da8841b41cd23f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f: \\mathbb{R}\\to \\mathbb{R}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"79\" height=\"16\" /> is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/d/7/7d7055008fb979689f45d8b87e708c6491eebf26.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textit{essentially increasing}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"155\" height=\"17\" /> if <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/b/d/5bd79ea1ceb1946e27b9d1f95c0c32c9a106dfd3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(s)\\leq f(t)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"91\" height=\"20\" /> holds whenever <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/b/f/bbf2a91f2ff5a5e2493a172dcd1536c36cf7c072.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$s\\leq t$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"41\" height=\"16\" /> are real numbers such that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/b/6/2b6308838a95edc6a9d2dc790781c8d4bfd51894.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(s)\\neq 0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"69\" height=\"20\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/2/a/a2a77aa9b519c36bef7d22cb59c5ae33595107df.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(t)\\neq 0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"67\" height=\"20\" />.\n</p><p>Find the smallest integer <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/c/3/8c325612684d41304b9751c175df7bcc0f61f64f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$k$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"14\" /> such that for any 2022 real numbers <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/7/3/573010f280e412734d8d8f78265f74ca54c962f3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x_1,x_2,\\ldots , x_{2022},$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"129\" height=\"13\" /> there exist <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/c/3/8c325612684d41304b9751c175df7bcc0f61f64f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$k$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"14\" /> essentially increasing functions <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/0/9/e09e887363ea9dcba08396fb1aa9ceea80730b5a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f_1,\\ldots, f_k$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"76\" height=\"18\" /> such that<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/f/1/ff18b495d0bfd0406f3c2471654f87b5d8be1544.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[f_1(n) + f_2(n) + \\cdots + f_k(n) = x_n\\qquad \\text{for every } n= 1,2,\\ldots 2022.\\]\" width=\"477\" height=\"18\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2022_USAMO_Problems/Problem_5&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/0/8/10865fb548314a203c8f9073fba74d3906e64549.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\textbf{Answer: } k = 1011.\\]\" width=\"149\" height=\"12\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/c/1/5c1c3141c4f8c22fa1f7a111f8bb9434fead33f6.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\textbf{Explanation:}\\]\" width=\"104\" height=\"15\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/e/8/2e89a9a0af13430c19c70208976b11e7111ef5da.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\text{A function } f:\\mathbb{R}\\to\\mathbb{R} \\text{ is essentially increasing if } f(s)\\le f(t) \\text{ whenever } s\\le t \\text{ and } f(s)\\ne 0,\\, f(t)\\ne 0.\\]\" width=\"748\" height=\"18\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/d/6/4d6d196f8a6888f8731a0fb907d31899e44e2c86.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\text{We want the smallest } k \\text{ such that for any } x_1,\\dots,x_{2022}, \\text{ we can write }\\]\" width=\"508\" height=\"16\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/f/e/bfef63a76152ad996718804bce68d8d568727c53.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[f_1(n)+f_2(n)+\\cdots+f_k(n)=x_n \\quad \\text{for all } n.\\]\" width=\"335\" height=\"18\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/7/5/175119bdece52a7f9d6cbb71423166cff965e49a.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\textbf{Lower bound:}\\]\" width=\"112\" height=\"12\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/e/d/5edab2c047837a865440614e422bfa43a943f443.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\text{Consider } x_1 &gt; x_2 &gt; \\cdots &gt; x_{2022}.\\]\" width=\"239\" height=\"14\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/8/e/48e8851c8fbdf1d6c3ee18633f5cd9a16226116b.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\text{Each essentially increasing function can contribute nonzero values}\\]\" width=\"478\" height=\"15\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/a/b/cab92d56552ee52796d578a9a5c85bc3b24303b5.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\text{on at most 2 positions (otherwise monotonicity is violated).}\\]\" width=\"433\" height=\"16\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/f/5/3f585469db913d88300a36e0decce8b45d494790.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\Rightarrow k \\ge \\left\\lceil \\frac{2022}{2} \\right\\rceil = 1011.\\]\" width=\"181\" height=\"42\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/d/4/2d44d7a4cef4147fa13c2b40ed6a1c371d9277f2.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\textbf{Upper bound:}\\]\" width=\"115\" height=\"15\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/7/7/777eac530c290271711d563fbae22e7eaca43825.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\text{Group indices as } (1,2), (3,4), \\dots, (2021,2022).\\]\" width=\"353\" height=\"18\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/f/e/2fec87bb89ad348c96c007a1451623da73252d7f.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\text{For each pair, define one function that matches } x_{2i-1}, x_{2i}\\]\" width=\"418\" height=\"15\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/8/d/b8db955974cff196b19ca0101cb7641e653fe6ef.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\text{and is zero elsewhere. This satisfies the condition.}\\]\" width=\"362\" height=\"12\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/0/8/6084134d3687d263b29ea2de2bfa6d9ec84cf93e.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\Rightarrow k \\le 1011.\\]\" width=\"96\" height=\"15\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/5/c7542a3a3f45fca7a079af76492dc1976fe0f393.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\textbf{Therefore, } \\boxed{1011}.\\]\" width=\"143\" height=\"23\" />\n<a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=~Trashboycan\" title=\"~Trashboycan\">~Trashboycan</a>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2022_USAMO_Problems/Problem_5&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:40%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2022_USAMO\" title=\"2022 USAMO\">2022 USAMO</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2022_USAMO_Problems\" title=\"2022 USAMO Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=27&amp;year=2022\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2022_USAMO_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"2022 USAMO Problems/Problem 4\">Problem 4</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2022_USAMO_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"2022 USAMO Problems/Problem 6\">Problem 6</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2022_USAMO_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"2022 USAMO Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2022_USAMO_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"2022 USAMO Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2022_USAMO_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"2022 USAMO Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2022_USAMO_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"2022 USAMO Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2022_USAMO_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"2022 USAMO Problems/Problem 6\">6</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=USAMO_Problems_and_Solutions\" title=\"USAMO Problems and Solutions\"> All USAMO Problems and Solutions</a></b>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<div class=\"print\">\n<div style=\"display:flex;width:100%;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center\">\n<div>\n<p><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=File:AMC_Logo.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/images/d/d1/AMC_Logo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"97\" height=\"84\" class=\"mw-file-element\" /></a></span>\n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"flex-grow:1;text-align:right\">\n<p>These problems are copyrighted &#169; by the <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.maa.org\">Mathematical Association of America</a>. \n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n</div></div>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time